From 737d9c3d11b2fb4257a70b4a6553afcad62cd279 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick <nicholas.deschenes@sentry.io>
Date: Wed, 14 Jan 2026 07:26:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(search-bar): Add support for explicit boolean tags
 (#105606)

This PR adds in support to for explicit boolean tag attributes
`tags[<key>, boolean]`, in both the BE, and FE grammars. As well as
support in the FE search query builder to render these values correctly,
etc.

Ticket: EXP-687
